id: pm-ado-backend-conformance
title: Certify revision reconciliation on filesystem and native database backends
description: "Reuse the resolution, relation and recovery corpus against filesystem and a native database without a local tracker. Synthetic REST only; independent backend authority and migration fidelity evidence."
